{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.RothAuxiliaryConstruction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.RothAuxiliaryConstruction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.RothAuxiliaryPolynomial"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.exists_ofBox_of_solution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.exists_ofBox_of_solution","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L152-L174","doc":"**A solution of the system is an auxiliary polynomial.**\n\nEverything the construction has to deliver, from a coefficient vector that (a) is not identically\nzero on the box and (b) kills every vanishing condition of weight below `μ`.  Siegel's lemma\nsupplies exactly such a vector; this theorem is what turns it into a polynomial. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.index_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.index_map","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L145-L150","doc":"**The index is insensitive to an injective change of coefficient ring.**  Needed because the\nauxiliary polynomial is built over `𝓞 K` while `index` is read over `K`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.le_index_ofBox","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.le_index_ofBox","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L132-L143","doc":"**Solving the system forces the index.**  The conditions need only be imposed on the box:\noutside it the translate has no coefficients at all. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.coeff_translate_ofBox","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.coeff_translate_ofBox","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L120-L130","doc":"**The translate coefficients are the linear system.**  Each is `∑_n c_n · translateMatrix`,\nsummed over the whole box — the row of the matrix Siegel is handed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.support_ofBox_subset","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.support_ofBox_subset","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L110-L118","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.coeff_translate_eq_zero_of_notMem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.coeff_translate_eq_zero_of_notMem","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L93-L108","doc":"**Outside the box the translate has no coefficients**, because translation preserves every\n`degreeOf`.  This is what lets the linear system be indexed by the box alone. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.degreeOf_ofBox_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.degreeOf_ofBox_le","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L82-L91","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.coeff_ofBox","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.coeff_ofBox","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L75-L80","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.ofBox","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.ofBox","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L69-L73","doc":"**The polynomial carrying a prescribed coefficient vector on the box.**  This is what\nSiegel's solution vector becomes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.translateMatrix_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.translateMatrix_map","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L61-L66","doc":"**…hence so is the translate matrix.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:MvPolynomial.map_translate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"MvPolynomial.map_translate","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/RothAuxiliaryConstruction.lean#L40-L59","doc":"**`translate` is natural in the coefficient ring.** ","signatureChunk":0}]}